+- **Evidence:** static routing assertions, generated recommendation results and actual specialized-command execution are distinct. Do not report fabricated quality scores, timing, savings or test counts. A report-only stop can still write tool-owned artifacts; memory, product edits, Git operations and external publication must be described separately.
 
